@startuml lld-us10-class
title LLD-US10 Get a statement for a date range: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class StatementController <<controller>> {
  + get(acc, from, to)
}
class StatementService <<service>> {
  + query()
}
class RangeValidator <<component>> {
  - maxMonths = 12
  + check(from, to)
}
StatementController --> RangeValidator
StatementController --> StatementService
@enduml